{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","id":"4367e105787e475fd238bd93","canonicalUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244%40gmail.com/","channels":["linux-i2c"],"thread":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thread:lore-git:20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com","source":{"kind":"static-generated","canonicalThreadUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244%40gmail.com/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","contentDigest":"lore-git:20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com"},"subject":"[PATCH] i2c: hix5hd2: fix autosuspend cleanup","messages":{"20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com":{"id":"20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com","messageId":"20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com","references":[],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Guangshuo Li","address":"lgs201920130244@gmail.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Andi Shyti","address":"andi.shyti@kernel.org"},{"name":"Zhangfei Gao","address":"zhangfei.gao@linaro.org"},{"name":"Wei Yan","address":"sledge.yanwei@huawei.com"},{"name":"Wolfram Sang","address":"wsa@kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-i2c@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"}],"cc":[{"name":"Guangshuo Li","address":"lgs201920130244@gmail.com"},{"name":"","address":"stable@vger.kernel.org"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-12T08:20:47.000Z","iso":"2026-08-12T08:20:47.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"[PATCH] i2c: hix5hd2: fix autosuspend cleanup","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-i2c.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-i2c.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"hix5hd2_i2c_probe() calls pm_runtime_use_autosuspend(), but the probe\nfailure and remove paths do not call the matching\npm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend() before disabling runtime PM."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"If the autosuspend delay is set to a negative value while autosuspend\nis enabled, the runtime PM core increments usage_count to prevent\nruntime suspend. Without undoing the autosuspend setting during\nteardown, this reference is not dropped and usage_count remains\nunbalanced."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Use devm_pm_runtime_set_active_enabled() to manage the runtime PM\nstate. Its managed cleanup disables autosuspend and runtime PM and\nrestores the suspended state on probe failure and driver removal.\nRemove the now redundant manual runtime PM cleanup."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"This issue was found by manual code inspection."},{"kind":"code","text":"Fixes: 15ef27756b23 (\"i2c: hix5hd2: add i2c controller driver\")\nCc: stable@vger.kernel.org"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Signed-off-by: Guangshuo Li <lgs201920130244@gmail.com>"},{"kind":"patch","patchId":"patch:20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com:0:0"}],"patchIds":["patch:20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com:0:0"],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[]}},"rootIds":["20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com"],"childrenByParent":{},"chronologicalIds":["20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{"patch:20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com:0:0":{"id":"patch:20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com:0:0","messageId":"20260812082047.3148742-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com","subject":"[PATCH] i2c: hix5hd2: fix autosuspend cleanup","commitMessage":[],"files":[{"oldPath":"drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-hix5hd2.c","newPath":"drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-hix5hd2.c","displayPath":"drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-hix5hd2.c","status":"modified","hunks":[{"header":"@@ -449,18 +449,13 @@ static int hix5hd2_i2c_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)","oldStart":449,"oldCount":18,"newStart":449,"newCount":13,"lines":[{"kind":"context","text":"","oldLine":449,"newLine":449},{"kind":"context","text":"\tpm_runtime_set_autosuspend_delay(priv->dev, MSEC_PER_SEC);","oldLine":450,"newLine":450},{"kind":"context","text":"\tpm_runtime_use_autosuspend(priv->dev);","oldLine":451,"newLine":451},{"kind":"deletion","text":"\tpm_runtime_set_active(priv->dev);","oldLine":452},{"kind":"deletion","text":"\tpm_runtime_enable(priv->dev);","oldLine":453},{"kind":"addition","text":"\tret = devm_pm_runtime_set_active_enabled(priv->dev);","newLine":452},{"kind":"addition","text":"\tif (ret)","newLine":453},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\treturn ret;","newLine":454},{"kind":"context","text":"","oldLine":454,"newLine":455},{"kind":"context","text":"\tret = i2c_add_adapter(&priv->adap);","oldLine":455,"newLine":456},{"kind":"context","text":"\tif (ret < 0)","oldLine":456,"newLine":457},{"kind":"deletion","text":"\t\tgoto err_runtime;","oldLine":457},{"kind":"deletion","text":"","oldLine":458},{"kind":"deletion","text":"\treturn ret;","oldLine":459},{"kind":"deletion","text":"","oldLine":460},{"kind":"deletion","text":"err_runtime:","oldLine":461},{"kind":"deletion","text":"\tpm_runtime_disable(priv->dev);","oldLine":462},{"kind":"deletion","text":"\tpm_runtime_set_suspended(priv->dev);","oldLine":463},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\treturn ret;","newLine":458},{"kind":"context","text":"","oldLine":464,"newLine":459},{"kind":"context","text":"\treturn ret;","oldLine":465,"newLine":460},{"kind":"context","text":"}","oldLine":466,"newLine":461}]},{"header":"@@ -470,8 +465,6 @@ static void hix5hd2_i2c_remove(struct platform_device *pdev)","oldStart":470,"oldCount":8,"newStart":465,"newCount":6,"lines":[{"kind":"context","text":"\tstruct hix5hd2_i2c_priv *priv = platform_get_drvdata(pdev);","oldLine":470,"newLine":465},{"kind":"context","text":"","oldLine":471,"newLine":466},{"kind":"context","text":"\ti2c_del_adapter(&priv->adap);","oldLine":472,"newLine":467},{"kind":"deletion","text":"\tpm_runtime_disable(priv->dev);","oldLine":473},{"kind":"deletion","text":"\tpm_runtime_set_suspended(priv->dev);","oldLine":474},{"kind":"context","text":"}","oldLine":475,"newLine":468},{"kind":"context","text":"","oldLine":476,"newLine":469},{"kind":"context","text":"static int hix5hd2_i2c_runtime_suspend(struct device *dev)","oldLine":477,"newLine":470},{"kind":"deletion","text":"- ","oldLine":478},{"kind":"metadata","text":"2.43.0"},{"kind":"metadata","text":""},{"kind":"metadata","text":""}]}],"binary":false}],"trailers":[],"rawText":"diff --git a/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-hix5hd2.c b/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-hix5hd2.c\nindex 95ab910b80c0..f3b967316a2d 100644\n--- a/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-hix5hd2.c\n+++ b/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-hix5hd2.c\n@@ -449,18 +449,13 @@ static int hix5hd2_i2c_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)\n \n \tpm_runtime_set_autosuspend_delay(priv->dev, MSEC_PER_SEC);\n \tpm_runtime_use_autosuspend(priv->dev);\n-\tpm_runtime_set_active(priv->dev);\n-\tpm_runtime_enable(priv->dev);\n+\tret = devm_pm_runtime_set_active_enabled(priv->dev);\n+\tif (ret)\n+\t\treturn ret;\n \n \tret = i2c_add_adapter(&priv->adap);\n \tif (ret < 0)\n-\t\tgoto err_runtime;\n-\n-\treturn ret;\n-\n-err_runtime:\n-\tpm_runtime_disable(priv->dev);\n-\tpm_runtime_set_suspended(priv->dev);\n+\t\treturn ret;\n \n \treturn ret;\n }\n@@ -470,8 +465,6 @@ static void hix5hd2_i2c_remove(struct platform_device *pdev)\n \tstruct hix5hd2_i2c_priv *priv = platform_get_drvdata(pdev);\n \n \ti2c_del_adapter(&priv->adap);\n-\tpm_runtime_disable(priv->dev);\n-\tpm_runtime_set_suspended(priv->dev);\n }\n \n static int hix5hd2_i2c_runtime_suspend(struct device *dev)\n-- \n2.43.0\n\n","statistics":{"files":1,"additions":4,"deletions":12},"diagnostics":[]}}}}